      "widgets_values": [
        "## Ideogram 4: inpainting\n\nRepaints the masked area of an image with Ideogram 4 (not an inpaint model: the masked latent is re-noised and sampled\nwith the rest of the image as context), for instance to fix or replace lettering. **Differential Diffusion** makes a\nsoft (feathered) mask blend gradually; the result is pasted back through the original mask, so nothing outside it\nchanges.\n\nIdeogram 4 (Qwen3-VL 8B text encoder, FLUX.2 VAE) is strong at typography and layout. Write full sentences,\nput literal text in quotes and say where it goes. Guidance comes from a second, **unconditional** model\n(**Dual Model CFG Guider**), so there is no negative prompt; **CFG Override** lowers CFG to 3 over the last 30 % of\nthe steps.\n\n**Presets** (steps / Shift = scheduler `mu` / scheduler `std`): Default 20 / 0 / 1.75, Quality 48 / 0 / 1.5,\nTurbo 12 / 0.5 / 1.75. CFG 7, euler, 1024×1024 (multiples of 16, at least 256). `std` is set in the scheduler.\n\n## Image Bench\n\nThe Generate tab is in **Inpaint** mode while this workflow is loaded.\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:img` | Load Image | Input cell; \"Send image\" from Photoshop |\n| `ib:mask` | Load Image Mask | Mask cell; the Photoshop selection |\n| `ib:cp`, `ib:pp`, `ib:lora` | as in `image_ideogram4_full.json` | model, prompt, LoRAs |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed, steps, Shift (`mu`), CFG scale, sampling method, denoising (Denoise) |\n\nThe loaders refer to the files the Photoshop plugin writes (`image_bench_photoshop_*.png`); send an image and a\nmask, or set them in the Input / Mask cells of the Generate tab, before the first queue.\n\n- Describe the **whole image**, including the new content of the masked area.\n- Denoising 0.85-1.0 replaces the content, 0.4-0.7 keeps its colors and shapes.\n- The image keeps its size (the scheduler reads it); keep the sides multiples of 16 and at least 256.\n\n## Model Links\n\n**diffusion_models**: [ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_fp8_scaled.safetensors), [ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Ideogram-4/resolve/main/diffusion_models/ideogram4_unconditional_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen3-VL/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_fp8_scaled.safetensors)\n**vae**: [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: Ideogram 4 inpainting (Image Bench)",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
